  ```
  output[batch, height, width, out_channel] =
      sum_{dheight, dwidth, in_channel} (
          filters[dheight, dwidth, in_channel, out_channel] *
          value[batch, height + rate*dheight, width + rate*dwidth, in_channel]
      )
  ```

